---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { en } from '../../data/en';
---
<BaseLayout
  content={en}
  path="/en/legal/"
  altPath="/legal/"
  altLang="es"
  title="Legal Notice and Privacy Policy | PCAlhaurín"
  description="Legal notice and privacy policy for PCAlhaurín."
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="section legal-content">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Legal Notice</h2>
        <p>This website is owned by an individual providing computer repair services in the province of Málaga, Spain.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Domain</strong>: pcalhaurin.es</li>
          <li><strong>Location</strong>: Alhaurín de la Torre, Málaga, Spain</li>
          <li><strong>Contact</strong>: +34 614 47 99 22 (WhatsApp)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>This site does not collect personal data through forms or cookies. The only means of contact is WhatsApp or phone, initiated by the user.</p>

        <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
        <h3>What data I process</h3>
        <p>Only what you voluntarily provide when contacting me via WhatsApp or phone: your name, phone number, and a description of your computer issue.</p>
        <h3>What I use it for</h3>
        <p>Exclusively to handle your enquiry, provide a quote, and carry out the agreed repair. I do not send marketing messages or share your data with third parties.</p>
        <h3>How long I keep it</h3>
        <p>I keep WhatsApp messages for the duration of our service relationship. You can ask me to delete your conversation at any time.</p>
        <h3>Your rights</h3>
        <p>You can exercise your rights of access, rectification, erasure and objection by contacting me via WhatsApp or phone at +34 614 47 99 22.</p>
        <h3>Cookies</h3>
        <p>This website does not use cookies. There is no tracking, analytics or advertising.</p>

        <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>All photographs on this site are my own work. Text and design are property of the site owner. Reproduction without permission is prohibited.</p>

        <hr />
        <p><em>Last updated: August 2026</em></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
